* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS vin vout
C1 VA VX 1p
C2 VX net6 1p
C3 VC VD 1p
C4 VD net9 1p
M1 vin phi1 VA VSS nch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
